      "heading": "Technical Analysis and MITRE ATT&CK Mapping",
      "content": [
        {
          "statement_id": "stmt-024",
          "text": "The packet does not contain login, authentication, session, or authenticated device telemetry sufficient to verify control of ACC-B1.",
